Z||000000||SLYGUY||10-01-2001||01:58 AM||||I noticed on my GT that in one of the windows in the instrument cluster (near the beloved "Service Engine Soon" light) there is an arrow pointing upwards. <P>In my parents 88 duke coupe it worked. Does this have any applications for the V6?<P>Thanks again for your info!!<P>Sly<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/SLYGUYSIG.jpg"> ||||reg||5
